{"-1 follows local structure; 0 reduces skin structure independently.\nThis is not a skin-colour/tone off switch. Use the final skin/scene controls below for that.", "-1 跟随局部结构，0 可独立降低皮肤结构。这不是肤色或色调开关，相关控制在下方最终效果中。"},
