{"Default", "默认"},
{"Default none. Added to the base skip list only for real network passes 2/3; pass 1 is unchanged.\nThis changes the style and usually saves little time. Not a cheaper equivalent of full multi-pass.\nBlocks 4/69 and byte-stream C64/C128/C256 blocks are unsupported; invalid combinations fall back to no extra skipping.\nPress Enter to apply; rebuilds next frame. Ignored with one pass. A predicted third pass has no extra network blocks.\nINI: DLSS5_MULTI_PASS_SKIP_BLOCKS.", "默认 none，仅给第 2/3 次真实网络推理追加跳块，第 1 层不变。会改变风格，通常只节省少量时间，不等同于低成本完整多层。\n不支持 4/69 和字节流 C64/C128/C256 对应块，无效组合回退为不追加跳块。按 Enter 应用，下一帧重建。单层忽略；预测的第 3 层没有额外网络块。INI：DLSS5_MULTI_PASS_SKIP_BLOCKS。"},
{"Default off. At 2/3 passes, blend skin-coloured regions toward pass 1.\nColour heuristic: may select warm scenery or miss skin under coloured lighting. Ignored with one pass.\nINI: DLSS5_MULTI_PASS_SKIN_PROTECT. Changes rebuild the network next frame.", "默认关闭。2/3 层时将肤色区域向第 1 层结果混合。按颜色识别皮肤，可能把暖色背景也识别进去，或漏掉彩色光照下的皮肤；单层忽略。INI：DLSS5_MULTI_PASS_SKIN_PROTECT。下一帧重建生效。"},
{"Default on in 0.41. Only active with 3 passes: run two real passes and predict the third locally.\nApproximate result; turn off for three real network passes. Passes 1/2 are unchanged by this option.\nINI: DLSS5_MULTI_PASS_PREDICT. Changes rebuild the network next frame.", "0.41 默认开启，仅在 3 层模式生效：两次真实推理后局部预测第 3 层。有近似误差；关闭后执行三次真实推理，不影响 1/2 层。INI：DLSS5_MULTI_PASS_PREDICT。下一帧重建生效。"},
{"Defines the motion range over which the effect ramps from zero to full strength.\n\nValues above the threshold are mapped into this range.\nLarger values make the response smoother and more gradual.\nSmaller values make the effect react more quickly and aggressively.", "超过阈值后，效果从零升至满强度所需的运动范围。范围大则变化平缓，范围小则响应更激进。"},
