{"If you are using an AMD/Intel GPU, then make sure you have fakenvapi", "AMD / Intel 显卡请确认已启用 FakeNVAPI。"},
{"Ignore Init Checks", "忽略初始化检查"},
{"Ignores all prechecks for XeFG\nDon't use this option to skip MV size warning for UE games!\nIt might cause crashes and bad IQ!", "跳过 XeFG 的初始化预检查。不要用它绕过虚幻引擎游戏的运动矢量尺寸警告，否则可能崩溃或严重影响画质。"},
{"Ignores small depth differences before edge detection.\n\nHigher values reduce flickering and noise from minor depth changes, but may soften real geometry edges.\nLower values preserve fine detail but can cause unstable or noisy edge detection.", "边缘检测前忽略较小的深度差。增大可降低细微深度变化引起的闪烁和噪点，但可能柔化真实边缘；减小保留细节，也更容易不稳定。"},
{"Ignores the value sent by the game\nand uses the value set below", "忽略游戏传入值，使用下方设置。"},
{"Immediate Capture", "立即捕获"},
{"Increasing this scales FSR3.1 computed shading\nchange value at read to have higher reactiveness.", "放大 FSR3.1 计算的着色变化量，使算法更快响应画面变化。"},
{"Increasing this value may reduce white pixel temporal\nflickering around swaying thin objects that are disoccluding \none another often. Too high value may increase ghosting.", "增大可减少细小摆动物体相互遮挡时的白点闪烁，过高则可能增加拖影。"},
