{"Leave off unless a game needs NR on lists that use\nenhanced barriers (may corrupt state / TDR). Restart.", "默认关闭。仅当游戏需要在使用增强屏障的列表上执行 NR 时尝试；可能损坏状态或触发驱动超时重置。修改后重启。"},
{"Leaves Streamline, Reflex and FG control to the game/external mod.\nNR and NGX upscaling remain available. Save Settings and restart.\nDoes not install an unlocker or enable FG in unsupported games.", "将 Streamline、Reflex 和帧生成交给游戏或外部模组控制。NR 与 NGX 超分仍可用；保存后重启生效。此选项不会安装解锁工具，也不会为不支持的游戏增加帧生成。"},
{"Lets you override each preset's ratio individually\nNote that not every game supports every quality preset\n\n1.5x on a 1080p screen means internal resolution of 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720", "分别覆盖各画质档位的倍率，游戏不一定支持全部档位。例如 1080p 输出设为 1.5 倍，对应内部渲染 720p。"},
