{"Magnifier", "放大镜"},
{"Make a copy of depth to use with OptiFG\nFor preventing corruptions that might happen", "为 OptiFG 复制深度，避免资源被覆盖造成画面错误。"},
{"Make a copy of motion vectors to use with OptiFG\nFor preventing corruptions that might happen", "为 OptiFG 复制运动矢量，避免资源被覆盖造成画面错误。"},
{"Make the picture look right, then press this -- it captures the current look\nas a point. For the first point use the Paper white slider above; for\nevery point after, move to different light and use the Trim, which the\nAnchor then bakes into a new point.\n\nThe first press calibrates one point -- the white point then\nfollows the scan by ratio from there, as before. Walk into very\ndifferent light, set paper white again, and press it again: the\nsecond point pins down the buffer's real curve and everything\nbetween the two is right, not just near one anchor. Up to eight.\n\nThe table is per game and shareable: one person calibrates a game\nand the numbers are the same for everyone who takes the profile.", "先将画面调好，再保存当前状态为锚点。第一个点使用参考白；之后换到不同光照，用扫描倍率调节再锚定。一个点按比例跟踪，两个点可确定曲线，最多八个。锚点表按游戏保存，可分享给其他用户。"},
{"Makes a copy of the depth buffer\nCan fix broken visuals in some games on AMD GPUs under Windows\nCan cause stutters, so best to use only when necessary", "复制深度缓冲，可能修复 Windows 下 AMD 显卡在部分游戏中的异常画面，也可能引起卡顿，建议仅在需要时使用。"},
{"Manual paper white when Auto exposure is off\n(including when the game sends pre-exposure).\nHigher darkens the network input and weakens\nhighlight rolloff. Default 8.", "关闭自动曝光时的手动参考白（包括游戏提供预曝光时）。增大会压暗网络输入并减弱高光压缩，默认 8。"},
{"Matched residual", "匹配残差"},
{"Maximum amount of sharpness that motion can add or remove.\n\nNegative values reduce sharpening in motion (recommended).\nPositive values increase sharpening in motion.\n\nThe final adjustment scales with motion and is capped at this value.", "运动可增加或减少的最大锐化量。推荐负值以降低运动中的锐化；正值增强。实际调整随运动变化，并受此值限制。"},
{"Meant for development purpose to test if\nwriting a larger value to reactive mask, reduces ghosting.", "开发调试项：增大响应遮罩值，观察是否减少拖影。"},
{"Menu", "菜单"},
