{"Off", "关闭"},
{"Off (default): 1152 processing rows. On: 1088 rows.\nMay reduce NR time but changes the image, especially near the bottom edge.\nOnly affects the 1080 tier; rebuilds on the next frame.", "默认关闭，处理高度为 1152；开启后为 1088。可降低耗时，但会改变画面，尤其是底部边缘。只影响 1080 档位，下一帧重建生效。"},
{"Off (soft knee)", "关闭（柔和拐点）"},
{"Off is the normal picture.\nProxy is what the network is shown. Model output is its raw answer.\nDifference amplifies the edit.\nApplies on the next frame. No restart.", "关闭时显示正常画面。模型输入显示送入网络的画面，模型输出是原始结果，差异视图放大显示修改。下一帧生效，无需重启。"},
{"Off preserves colour in selected pixels; lighting/detail can still change.\nAlso set Skin detail / lighting to 0 to suppress both.", "关闭后保留选中像素的色彩，光照和细节仍可改变。若要同时抑制，请将皮肤细节 / 光照也设为 0。"},
{"Off. The model stays loaded, so turning this back on is immediate.", "已关闭。模型仍驻留，重新开启会立即生效。"},
{"Off: Temporal history on, skip a frame if the previous network is\nstill busy. Closer to 60 FPS; more ghosting because FSR also accumulates.\n\nOn: after Execute, wait for the HIP job only (Temporal off). Does not wait\nfor the D3D12 fence / FSR batch. Closer to danielblnc 0.3's 40+ at a 4K FSR\nUltra Performance render; the next Record may still skip if GPU work is\nin flight.", "关闭：使用时序历史，上一帧网络仍忙时跳过当前帧；帧率通常更高，但与 FSR 历史累积叠加可能增加拖影。\n开启：Execute 后仅等待 HIP 工作，不等待 D3D12 Fence / FSR 批次，不使用此历史模式；GPU 工作未完成时下一次 Record 仍可能跳过。实际帧率取决于游戏和设置。"},
{"On", "开启"},
{"On (default): game waits for NR in the same frame (historical path).\nOff: async (daniel Async=1); pre-upscale is forced off because it requires inline.\nSaved to dlssnr_on_amd.ini only with Save Settings. Restart may be required.", "默认开启：游戏同帧等待 NR，沿用原路径。关闭后改为异步处理（Daniel Async=1）。超分前的 NR 需要同帧等待，因此也会被关闭。点击保存设置才写入 dlssnr_on_amd.ini，可能需要重启。"},
{"On (default): larger Color is fitted onto the 1080 network.\nThat can cost same-frame time and memory.\nOff: a wide frame is admitted only when width is\nat most 2560, height at most 1080, and the pixel count stays\nwithin 1920x1080. 2024x848 passes. 2560x1080 does not.\nApplies on the next frame, including after a resolution change.\nThe network may rebuild once. No restart.", "默认开启：将较大色彩输入适配到 1080 网络，可能增加同帧耗时和显存。关闭后，宽屏输入需同时满足宽 ≤2560、高 ≤1080、像素数 ≤1920×1080；2024×848 可用，2560×1080 不可用。下一帧生效，分辨率改变后可能重建一次，无需重启。"},
{"On (default): lmxxf picks the smallest tier that fits.\nOff: pin NR to one tier in the menu below.\nApplies on the next network rebuild. Written to OptiScaler.ini with Save Settings.", "默认开启：lmxxf 选择能容纳输入的最小档位。关闭后可固定下方档位。下次重建网络时生效，点击保存设置写入 INI。"},
{"On (default): prepare hot switching when lmxxf is installed. Restart after changing.\nOff: start with only the selected backend; changing backends needs a game restart.\nAlso OptiScaler.ini [DlssNr] NrConvenience=0/1.", "默认开启：安装 lmxxf 时预先准备热切换。关闭后仅加载所选后端，切换需重启。修改后重启生效；INI：[DlssNr] NrConvenience=0/1。"},
{"On (default): run at the NR input size, padded for the network.\nNR -> SR uses render resolution; SR -> NR uses the upscaled output resolution.\nHigher resolutions cost more GPU time and VRAM; 4K can be several times slower than 1080p.\nOverrides tier and Compact 1080 settings within the supported processing budget.\nOutside that budget, use the tier settings below. Changes rebuild the network next frame.", "默认开启：按 NR 输入尺寸处理，并补齐网络所需边界。NR -> SR 使用渲染分辨率；SR -> NR 使用超分输出分辨率。\n分辨率越高，GPU 时间和显存占用越高，4K 可能比 1080p 慢数倍。输入尺寸在支持范围内时，忽略分辨率档位和紧凑 1080 设置；超出范围时，改用下方选择的档位。修改后下一帧重建网络。"},
{"On + Ext", "开启并扩展"},
{"On by default. 0.41 extends approximate math from C32/C64/C128 to ViT and C512 projection.\nOutput can differ from 0.40 even with 1/2 passes.\nOff selects the normal numeric modules. Changing this rebuilds the network next frame.", "默认开启。0.41 将近似计算从 C32/C64/C128 扩展到 ViT 和 C512 投影，所以即使 1/2 层也可能与 0.40 不同。关闭使用普通数值模块。下一帧重建生效。"},
{"On: New wait mode (0.3.1 1-pixel draw). Still being tested.\nOff: Original wait mode (switches immediately).\nRestart if prompted: hooks or a pass may not be ready for new wait mode.\nFrames that cannot use new wait mode still fall back to original wait.", "开启：新等待方式（0.3.1 的单像素绘制），仍在测试。关闭：立即切回原等待方式。Hook 或计算层未准备好时按提示重启；不能使用新方式的帧仍回退原方式。"},
{"One pass, 100% image resolution. Restart after resizing the output.", "单层，按画面 100% 分辨率处理。修改输出分辨率后请重启。"},
{"One that only ever climbs is a counter, not an exposure.", "只增不减的值通常是计数器，不是曝光。"},
{"Only Generated", "仅生成帧"},
{"Only turn this off when neural rendering fails to start and the log says missing HIP export hipExtModuleLaunchKernel. Otherwise leave it on.", "仅在 NR 无法启动且日志提示 missing HIP export hipExtModuleLaunchKernel 时关闭，其他情况下保持开启。"},
{"Open release page", "打开发布页面"},
{"OptiScaler - %s for menu", "OptScaler(NR) - 按 %s 打开菜单"},
{"Option disabled because the game doesn't provide a Reactive mask", "游戏没有提供响应遮罩，此选项不可用。"},
{"Optional colour-based selection, NOT NVIDIA's automatic skin mask. Warm scenery can be selected and coloured lighting can hide skin. Check the preview. These controls affect the combined result of all passes.", "可选的色彩筛选，与 NVIDIA 自动肤色遮罩不同。可能误选暖色场景或漏选彩光下的皮肤，请检查预览。控制的是所有层合成后的最终结果。"},
{"Orange", "橙色"},
{"Original wait is active while NR submission hooks are enabled.", "启用 NR 提交 Hook 时使用原等待方式。"},
{"Output", "输出"},
{"Output Scaling", "输出缩放"},
{"Output Scaling is %s, Target Res: %dx%d (%.2f)\nJitter Count: %d", "输出缩放：%s，目标分辨率：%dx%d (%.2f)；抖动采样数：%d"},
{"Output adjustment", "输出调整"},
{"Overall Intensity", "整体强度"},
{"Overlaps HIP kernel launches. Leave this on.\nThe picture is the same either way.\nTurn it off only when neural rendering fails to start\nand the log says: missing HIP export hipExtModuleLaunchKernel.\nThe running chain does not pick this up.", "允许 HIP 内核启动重叠，通常应保持开启，画面结果不变。仅在 NR 无法启动且日志提示 missing HIP export hipExtModuleLaunchKernel 时关闭。已运行的计算链不会即时更新此项。"},
