{"Override DLSSG Ratio", "覆盖 DLSSG 倍率"},
{"Override Maximum", "覆盖上限"},
{"Override Minimum", "覆盖下限"},
{"Override XeFG only after DLSS NR successfully runs.\nNever changes the base multiplier or enables frame generation.\nNR off/failure/session rebuild restores the current base multiplier.\nSkipped frames and pauses keep the override. Save Settings to persist.\nChanging multipliers briefly pauses/rearms frame generation.", "仅在 NR 成功运行后覆盖 XeFG 倍率，不改变基础倍率，也不会开启帧生成。NR 关闭、失败或会话重建时恢复当前基础倍率；跳帧和暂停保留覆盖。保存设置可持久化。切换倍率会短暂停止并重新启用帧生成。"},
{"Override all", "覆盖全部档位"},
{"Override all textures mipmap values\nNormally OptiScaler only overrides\nbelow zero mipmap values!", "覆盖所有纹理的 Mipmap 偏移；默认仅覆盖小于零的偏移。"},
{"Override inherited controls", "单独设置"},
{"Override per quality preset", "按画质档位覆盖"},
{"Overrides every upscaler preset with the set value\n\n1.5x on a 1080p screen means an internal res of 720p\n1080 / 1.5 = 720", "用同一倍率覆盖全部超分档位。例如 1080p 输出设为 1.5 倍，对应内部渲染 720p：1080 / 1.5 = 720。"},
