{"Per shader breakdown:", "各着色器耗时："},
{"Per-pass overrides apply to the DX12 multipass path, including NR after RR. Native Vulkan and the driver-proxy backend remain single-pass.", "逐层覆盖适用于 DX12 多层路径，包括 RR 后 NR。原生 Vulkan 和驱动代理后端仍为单层。"},
{"Performance", "性能"},
{"Please select %s as upscaler from game\noptions and load a save game to enable Opti settings.\nUpscalers don't always work in menus.", "请在游戏选项中选择 %s 超分并载入存档，之后即可调整 OptiScaler。游戏菜单里不一定会运行超分。"},
{"Please select DLSS Frame Generation in the game options\nYou might need to select DLSS first", "请在游戏中选择 DLSS 帧生成，部分游戏需要先选择 DLSS 超分。"},
{"Please select FSR Frame Generation in the game options\nYou might need to select FSR first", "请在游戏中选择 FSR 帧生成，部分游戏需要先选择 FSR 超分。"},
{"Positioning", "位置"},
{"Positive values decrease sharpness at high contrast areas.\nNegative values increase sharpness at high contrast areas.", "正值降低高对比区域的锐化，负值增强该区域锐化。"},
{"Prebuild capacity", "层数预留"},
{"Prebuild passes", "预留层数"},
{"Automatic prebuild capacity grows as needed and is retained on pass reduction. Capacity is not the active pass count.", "自动按需预留更多层的资源；减少执行层数后，仍保留已准备的资源。预留层数不代表实际执行层数。"},
{"Resolution edits apply when editing finishes. 50% halves width and height.", "调整结束后应用分辨率。50% 表示宽和高各减半。"},
{"Pass edits apply when editing finishes. More passes increase GPU cost and memory.", "调整结束后应用层数。层数越多，GPU 耗时和显存占用越高。"},
{"DRS buckets reduce rebuilds when the render size changes. White point controls linear-input brightness.", "尺寸分档可减少动态分辨率变化引起的网络重建。参考白用于调整线性输入的亮度。"},
