{"Red", "红色"},
{"Reduces temporal variation in the NR correction using motion and depth.\nMay soften moving detail; disabled by default. Requires valid motion and depth inputs.", "利用运动矢量和深度，减少 NR 修正的逐帧变化。可能柔化运动细节，默认关闭，需要有效的运动和深度输入。"},
