{"Root Signatures", "根签名"},
{"Runs Neural Rendering on the render-resolution colour input immediately before\nSuper Resolution, so SR temporally accumulates and upscales the enhanced frame.\n\nRay Reconstruction is deliberately excluded: its input contract differs and\nuses the separate Apply after Ray Reconstruction option. Origin-zero padded\ninputs use their active render size; offset or invalid inputs fall back post-SR.\n\nThis placement control currently applies to the Direct3D 12 path and its\nDirect3D 11/Vulkan bridges; native Vulkan keeps the post-upscale path.", "在超分前处理渲染分辨率的色彩输入，再由 SR 累积并放大增强后的画面。光线重建使用独立选项，所需的输入信息不同。原点为零的补齐输入按有效渲染尺寸处理；偏移或无效输入回退后置。适用于 DX12 及其 DX11 / Vulkan 桥接，原生 Vulkan 保留超分后路径。"},
{"Runs sequential model layers between one encode and one final composition.\nEach additional layer consumes the previous layer's model output and owns\na separate persistent feature and temporal history.\n\nThe base proxy stays immutable and the final answer is composed against it\nonce, so colour and transfer strength do not compound. Local tone is applied\nonly by the first layer.\n\nCost scales almost linearly. Two is the common 'deep fried' look; three is\nthe guarded ceiling because later layers converge while cost and artifacts grow.", "在一次编码与最终合成之间串行运行模型层。每层接收上一层输出，拥有独立持久特征和时序历史。最初送入模型的参考画面保持不变，仅最终结果合成一次，因此色彩和修正强度不会逐层叠乘；局部色调仅由第 1 层应用。开销近似随层数增长，后续层的效果趋于收敛，伪影和开销却会上升，因此上限为 3 层。"},
{"SR -> NR (experimental)", "SR -> NR（实验）"},
{"Safety Margins in ms", "安全余量 (ms)"},
{"Safety margins in millisecons\nFSR default value: 0.1ms\nOpti default value: 0.01ms", "安全余量，单位毫秒。FSR 默认 0.1ms，OptiScaler 默认 0.01ms。"},
