{"Save Settings, then restart the game to use %s.", "保存设置并重启游戏后，将使用 %s。"},
{"Save and restart to change startup hook preparation. Off loads only the active backend.", "修改启动时的 Hook 准备范围，保存后重启生效。关闭时仅加载当前后端。"},
