{"Scene detail / lighting", "环境细节 / 光照"},
{"Select 1-3 passes at the chosen NR/SR stage. With Predict third pass on, 3 uses two real passes plus a local prediction.\nPasses 2/3 add frame-sized buffers. Adaptive ViT reuse is disabled with multiple passes.\nChanging this rebuilds the network next frame; GPU timing includes all passes.", "在所选 NR / SR 阶段执行 1–3 层。开启第 3 层预测时，3 层实际为两次真实推理加局部预测。\n第 2/3 层需要额外的整帧缓冲，多层时禁用 ViT 自适应复用。修改后下一帧重建，GPU 耗时包含全部层。"},
{"Select source for frametime\nMight help frame pacing and stutter issues", "选择帧时间来源，可能改善帧节奏和卡顿。"},
{"Select the input color space that the game uses.\nNon-Linear / sRGB: Might improve FSR4 upscaling quality, might increase ghosting.\nPQ: Rarest, might increase ghosting and break lights.", "选择游戏使用的输入色彩空间。非线性 / sRGB 可能改善 FSR4 画质，也可能增加拖影；PQ 较少见，错误使用可能增加拖影或破坏光照。"},
{"Selected runtime is not installed. Use the package installer.", "所选后端尚未安装，请运行安装包中的安装器。"},
{"Selecting setting below will disable that external override\n", "选择下方设置将取消该外部覆盖。"},
{"Separate skin / environment controls", "分别控制肤色与环境"},
