{"Some NR processing still uses original wait.", "部分 NR 处理仍使用原等待方式。"},
{"Some Unreal Engine games need this\n\nTry using if colours flickering or\nobjects have ghosting trails", "部分虚幻引擎游戏需要自动曝光。遇到色彩闪烁或物体拖影时可以尝试。"},
