{"Static Pos X", "固定位置 X"},
{"Static Pos Y", "固定位置 Y"},
{"Static frames reuse ViT; motion returns to full cost.\nTemporarily incompatible with Temporal history due to flicker.\nEnabling adaptive reuse turns off ViT byte stream.\nStrength sliders are tunable (not bit-exact).\nApplies on the next network rebuild.", "静止画面复用 ViT，运动时恢复完整计算。因闪烁问题，暂时与时序历史互斥。开启自适应复用会关闭 ViT 字节流。阈值可调，但结果不是逐位一致。下次网络重建时生效。"},
{"Strength / colour", "强度 / 色彩"},
{"Strength / residual stabilization", "强度 / 残差稳定"},
{"Structure", "结构"},
{"Style", "风格"},
{"Style ", "风格 "},
{"Supersampling %.2fx: the model runs ABOVE native, then\nis sampled back down. Experimental, and costly -- time grows with the area.", "超采样 %.2f 倍：模型在高于原生分辨率运行后再缩小。实验选项，耗时随处理面积增长。"},
{"Swap sides", "交换两侧"},
{"Sync Int.", "同步间隔"},
{"Syncing Settings", "同步设置"},
{"Synthesises detail in the upscaler's frame, before frame generation sees it.\n\nNeeds two similarly named files beside OptiScaler, one character apart:\n  nvngx_dlssnr.dll       NVIDIA's model (~165 MB) -- you supply it\n  nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll   the forwarder (~13 KB) -- ships in this package\nUndocumented and driven directly, so none of this is officially supported.", "在帧生成之前为超分画面合成细节。OptiScaler 旁需要两个相近文件名：nvngx_dlssnr.dll 为 NVIDIA 模型（约 165MB，需自备）；nvngx.dll_dlssnr.dll 为转发器（约 13KB，包内提供）。此接口未公开，属于实验支持。"},
{"Teal", "青色"},
{"Temporal history", "时序历史"},
{"Temporal history (anti-flicker)", "时序历史（防闪烁）"},
{"The FG that you will actually be using", "实际执行帧生成的后端。"},
{"The data source to be used for FG\nThe native FG which the game supports", "帧生成所用的数据来源，即游戏原生支持的帧生成接口。"},
{"The filter that averages the model's above-native answer back to display size --\nthis is what turns supersampling into LESS noise rather than more. Sharper\nfilters (Lanczos3, Kaiser3) keep the most detail; softer ones (Bicubic,\nCatmull-Rom) are gentler on ringing. Independent of the Output Scaling\ndownscaler, so the two can differ and run at the same time.", "将高于原生分辨率的模型结果缩回显示尺寸的过滤器，有助于降低超采样噪点。Lanczos3 / Kaiser3 保留更多细节；Bicubic / Catmull-Rom 更柔和，振铃较少。与输出缩放的缩小算法独立，可同时使用。"},
{"The game's own exposure", "游戏自身曝光"},
{"The model was trained on finished, sRGB-encoded frames. The upscaler's\noutput is not one: it is linear and open-ended. These decide how it is\nmapped into something the model recognises. A frame the game reports as\nalready tone-mapped is passed over untouched and none of this applies.", "模型以完成色调映射的 sRGB 画面训练，而超分输出可能是未限制范围的线性图像。这些选项负责输入映射；游戏明确报告已完成色调映射时，直接使用原图，不应用此变换。"},
{"The most the pass may move any pixel, as a multiple of what it already was, in\nboth directions -- a pixel may not be brightened past this nor darkened past\nits reciprocal. Lights are where the model has least to say and rescaling its\nanswer does the most damage; 2x leaves detail intact while stopping a strip\nlight turning into a string of coloured cells. Raise it only if bright areas\nlook clipped.", "像素亮度最多改变多少倍，增亮不超过该倍数，变暗不低于其倒数。默认 2 倍通常可保留细节并防止灯带变成彩色块。仅在高光效果受限时提高。"},
{"The number runs the other way", "数值变化方向相反"},
{"The white point for the selected calibration point, or -- with no row\nselected -- the value the next Anchor press captures.\n\nSet it until the picture looks right here, then Anchor. Move to very\ndifferent light and do it again: two points fix the buffer's real\nrelationship and the white point holds between them. Click a row below\nto come back and adjust that point; click it again to let go.", "当前选中锚点的参考白；未选中时用于下一次锚定。先调至当前光照下合适，再设锚点；换到不同光照重复，两个点可确定缓冲的对应关系。点击已有行可重新调整，再点一次取消选择。"},
{"Then: Super Resolution -> game effects / HUD -> presentation", "后续：超分 -> 游戏后处理 / HUD -> 显示"},
