{"Wrap command lists created before the swapchain. Shared by lmxxf and Mochizuki.\nAuto: EXE calls in Unreal/Forza; UnityPlayer.dll calls in Aniimo only.\nForce on: EXE calls and UnityPlayer.dll calls in other Unity games too.\nForce off: disable both early paths; normal post-swapchain wrapping stays enabled.\nOther games are unvalidated; forcing early wrap can cause startup problems.\nSave and restart to apply. INI: LmxxfEarlyExeWrap.", "接管交换链创建前生成的命令列表，lmxxf 与 Mochizuki 共用。\n自动：虚幻 / Forza 的 EXE 调用，以及伊莫的 UnityPlayer.dll 调用。强制开启：还覆盖其他 Unity 游戏的 UnityPlayer.dll 调用。强制关闭：禁用上述提前接管，保留交换链创建后的正常接管。\n其他游戏未经验证，强制开启可能导致启动问题。保存后重启生效；INI：LmxxfEarlyExeWrap。"},
