{"daniel extras live in dlssnr_on_amd.ini [DlssNrOnAmd]: PollSpacing, OverlayKey, HipDevice, InlineWaitMs, ...\nIns menu / OptiScaler.ini win on Save for keys this menu exposes.\nOverlayKey only binds daniel's own overlay (unused when driving from Ins).\nProcess env (advanced, no Ins toggle): DLSSNR_NO_REG, DLSSNR_CHAIN, DLSSNR_NOBLEND, DLSSNR_NO_REPACK, DLSSNR_WBLOG.", "Daniel 额外选项位于 dlssnr_on_amd.ini 的 [DlssNrOnAmd]：PollSpacing、OverlayKey、HipDevice、InlineWaitMs 等。菜单已提供的键在保存时以 Ins / OptiScaler.ini 为准。OverlayKey 仅绑定 Daniel 自带叠加层。高级环境变量（无菜单开关）：DLSSNR_NO_REG、DLSSNR_CHAIN、DLSSNR_NOBLEND、DLSSNR_NO_REPACK、DLSSNR_WBLOG。"},
